BT
/F1 9 Tf 50 780 Td (PM-KISAN Guidelines ? Scheme Modalities & Financial Benefits) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 758 Tm /F2 12 Tf ([SECTION: Clause 2] SCHEME MODALITIES AND BENEFIT DISBURSEMENT) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 740 Tm /F1 10 Tf ([PARA | SEC=Clause 2.1] Under the PM-KISAN scheme, a financial benefit of Rs 6000 per annum is provided to all eligible farmer families. The financial benefit is payable in three equal four-monthly instalments of Rs 2000 each. The instalment periods are: Period 1 from April to July, Period 2 from August to November, and Period 3 from December to March.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 724 Tm /F2 10 Tf ([TABLE_START | ID=TBL_PMKISAN_BENEFIT_SCHEDULE | SEC=Clause 2.2 \(Table 1\) | CAPTION=Schedule of Financial Benefits and Periodicity under PM-KISAN]) Tj
