1 0 0 1 50 696 Tm /F1 9 Tf ([TABLE_ROW | ID=TBL_PMKISAN_BENEFIT_SCHEDULE | ROW=TBL_PMKISAN_BENEFIT_SCHEDULE_R1] First Instalment | April to July | 2000 | Four-monthly | Direct Benefit Transfer \(Aadhaar Seeded\)) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 683 Tm /F1 9 Tf ([TABLE_ROW | ID=TBL_PMKISAN_BENEFIT_SCHEDULE | ROW=TBL_PMKISAN_BENEFIT_SCHEDULE_R2] Second Instalment | August to November | 2000 | Four-monthly | Direct Benefit Transfer \(Aadhaar Seeded\)) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 670 Tm /F1 9 Tf ([TABLE_ROW | ID=TBL_PMKISAN_BENEFIT_SCHEDULE | ROW=TBL_PMKISAN_BENEFIT_SCHEDULE_R3] Third Instalment | December to March | 2000 | Four-monthly | Direct Benefit Transfer \(Aadhaar Seeded\)) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 657 Tm /F1 9 Tf ([TABLE_ROW | ID=TBL_PMKISAN_BENEFIT_SCHEDULE | ROW=TBL_PMKISAN_BENEFIT_SCHEDULE_R4] Annual Total Benefit | Full Financial Year | 6000 | Annual Total | Direct Benefit Transfer \(Aadhaar Seeded\)) Tj
