BT
/F1 9 Tf 50 780 Td (PM-KISAN Guidelines ? Beneficiary Eligibility Scope) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 758 Tm /F2 12 Tf ([SECTION: Clause 3] DEFINITION OF BENEFICIARY AND LANDHOLDING ELIGIBILITY) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 740 Tm /F1 10 Tf ([PARA | SEC=Clause 3.1] A landholder farmer family is defined as a family comprising husband, wife, and minor children who own cultivable land as per land records of the concerned State or Union Territory. As approved by the Union Cabinet on 31st May 2019 \(effective 1st April 2019\), the scheme covers all landholding eligible farmer families irrespective of the size of their landholdings.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 724 Tm /F1 10 Tf ([PARA | SEC=Clause 3.2] Tenant farmers, sharecroppers, and landless agricultural labourers who do not possess cultivable land ownership title in official revenue records are not eligible to receive benefits under the PM-KISAN scheme.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 40 Tm /F1 9 Tf ([PRINTED_PAGE: 3]) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
