/F1 9 Tf 50 780 Td (PM-KISAN Guidelines ? Statutory Exclusion Criteria) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 758 Tm /F2 12 Tf ([SECTION: Clause 4] EXCLUSION CRITERIA \(STATUTORY DISQUALIFICATION\)) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 740 Tm /F1 10 Tf ([PARA | SEC=Clause 4.1] The following categories of beneficiaries of higher economic status shall not be eligible for benefits under the scheme: Institutional landholders, former and present holders of constitutional posts, former and present Ministers, MPs, MLAs, serving or retired officers and employees of Central/State Government Ministries and PSEs \(excluding Class IV / Group D / MTS employees\), superannuated pensioners with monthly pension of Rs 10000 or more, income tax payees of last assessment year, and registered professionals.) Tj
