/F1 9 Tf 50 780 Td (PM-KISAN Guidelines ? Mandatory eKYC and Aadhaar DBT Modalities) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 758 Tm /F2 12 Tf ([SECTION: Clause 5] OPERATIONAL COMPLIANCE AND BENEFIT TRANSFER) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 740 Tm /F1 10 Tf ([PARA | SEC=Clause 5.1] Financial benefits under PM-KISAN are transferred 100 percent electronically through the Aadhaar Payment Bridge System \(APBS\) directly into Aadhaar-seeded bank accounts of verified farmers. Completion of eKYC \(electronic Know Your Customer\) is 100 percent mandatory for all registered beneficiaries before the release of subsequent instalments.) Tj
